NOTICE
======

This crate redistributes third-party source. What follows names it, states its
licence, and says exactly what was changed -- in that order, because the third
part is the one a rebase needs.

The text used to sit under `csrc/vendor/`. It does not any more: there is no
vendor directory in this crate and no build step looks for one. The files were
`git mv`'d, subtree shape intact, into `csrc/src/attn/flashinfer/` and
`csrc/src/attn/xqa/` -- see "Where it lives, and why it moved" below. Nothing
about the licences, the copyrights or the obligations changes with the path;
only the paths in this document do.


