    cuda_hint.cuh  ldgsts.cuh    mhaUtils.cuh mma.cuh              specDec.h
    mha.cuh        mha_components.cuh         utils.cuh            utils.h

It was fifteen. `hostUtils.h` was deleted -- see "What was changed" below --
and the counts above are the tree as it now stands, re-derived rather than
adjusted. The previous figure in this document, `274,966 bytes`, was 36 bytes
under the truth for the fifteen-file tree it described; nothing had a second
derivation to disagree with it.

Not carried, and deliberately: `gmma.cuh`, `gmma_impl.cuh`, `mha_sm90.cu`,
